      "source": "Returns whether there's a previous <a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> we can access from the current one. Will return\nfalse in case the current <a href=\"Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> already refers to the first page.",
